# Review routing for the localized instruction layers. Each app, library, and
# tooling subtree carries its own AGENTS.md, so a change to one is reviewed by
# the owner of that subtree rather than by whoever notices the pull request.
# Only those subtrees are routed: a blanket `*` owner would claim every path in
# the repository to route the handful that need it, which is a grant far wider
# than the routing it exists for.
/AGENTS.md @nickderobertis
/apps/ @nickderobertis
/libs/ @nickderobertis
/scripts/ @nickderobertis
/.github/ @nickderobertis
/docs/ @nickderobertis
